<figcaption class="slide-caption"><span class="slide-title">Check 1: did it find the right page?</span><span class="slide-body">We look at what your search returned. If the pinned page is in there, that is a hit.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure class="slide" data-slide="2" hidden>
<svg viewBox="0 0 640 340" class="slide-svg" role="img" aria-label="The answer key says 20, the pipeline said 5, and the judge marks it wrong">
<rect x="60" y="66" width="220" height="132" rx="18" fill="#E0E7FF"></rect>
<path d="M110 198l-6 30 30-30z" fill="#E0E7FF"></path>
<text x="84" y="104" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#4338CA">answer key</text>
<text x="84" y="170" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="58" font-weight="800" fill="#4338CA">20</text>
<rect x="360" y="66" width="220" height="132" rx="18" fill="#FEF3C7" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3"></rect>
<path d="M530 198l6 30-30-30z" fill="#FEF3C7"></path>
<text x="384" y="104" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#92400E">your pipeline said</text>
<text x="384" y="170" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="58" font-weight="800" fill="#92400E">5</text>
<text x="320" y="152" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="44" font-weight="800" fill="#5B6577">≠</text>
<rect x="200" y="258" width="240" height="44" rx="22" fill="#1E1B4B"></rect>
<text x="320" y="286" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="16" font-weight="700" fill="#FFFFFF">judge model: wrong ✕</text>
</svg>
<figcaption class="slide-caption"><span class="slide-title">Check 2: was the answer right?</span><span class="slide-body">A separate judge model compares your pipeline’s answer to the answer key.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure class="slide" data-slide="3" hidden>
<svg viewBox="0 0 640 340" class="slide-svg" role="img" aria-label="A two by two grid: true pass, lucky pass highlighted, generation failure and retrieval failure">
<text x="250" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">found the page</text>
<text x="440" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">missed the page</text>
<text x="148" y="116" text-anchor="end" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">right</text>
<text x="148" y="246" text-anchor="end" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">wrong</text>
<rect x="160" y="56" width="180" height="118" rx="14" fill="#E0E7FF"></rect>
<text x="250" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="800" fill="#4338CA">true pass</text>
<text x="250" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#4338CA">it worked</text>
<rect x="350" y="56" width="180" height="118" rx="14" fill="#FEF3C7" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3"></rect>
<text x="440" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="800" fill="#92400E">lucky pass</text>
<text x="440" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#92400E">guessed from memory</text>
<path d="M520 46l5 11 12 1-9 8 3 12-11-6-11 6 3-12-9-8 12-1z" fill="#F59E0B"></path>
<rect x="160" y="184" width="180" height="118" rx="14" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD2DE" stroke-width="2"></rect>
<text x="250" y="240" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#111827">generation fail</text>
<text x="250" y="266" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#5B6577">fix the prompt</text>
<rect x="350" y="184" width="180" height="118" rx="14" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD2DE" stroke-width="2"></rect>
<text x="440" y="240" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="800" fill="#111827">retrieval fail</text>
<text x="440" y="266" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#5B6577">fix the search</text>
</svg>
<figcaption class="slide-caption"><span class="slide-title">Two checks, four verdicts</span><span class="slide-body">A lucky pass is a right answer from the wrong page. Most tests count it as a win; ragaudit flags it.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
