<text x="320" y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">chunk size · top-k · re-rank</text>
<rect x="444" y="96" width="140" height="132" rx="14" fill="#1E1B4B"></rect>
<rect x="497" y="144" width="34" height="28" rx="5" fill="#F59E0B"></rect>
<path d="M503 144v-10a11 11 0 0 1 22 0v10" fill="none" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="5"></path>
<text x="514" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="800" fill="#FFFFFF">final exam</text>
<text x="514" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#FFFFFF">locked · 3 of 10</text>
<text x="514" y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#5B6577">opened once, at the end</text>
