<text x="320" y="314" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#111827">practice high, exam low = it memorised, alarm rings</text>
</svg>
<figcaption class="slide-caption"><span class="slide-title">Then it gets better on its own</span><span class="slide-body">ragaudit tune tries settings on practice questions and keeps what scores better. A locked final exam is opened once, so the score can’t be faked.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
